name: "You"
type: "text"
text: "Hi, my name is Jame. I want to ask you a few questions if you don't mind."
name: "Roxy"
type: "text"
text: "Hi, I'm Roxy. What is it that you would like to ask me?"
name: "You"
type: "text"
text: "I arrived in this village looking for the owner of this letter."
name: " "
type: "text"
text: "(handed the letter to Roxy.)"
name: "Roxy"
type: "text"
text: "This letter is from a yellow house on the east side.|The house is empty now, with only enough furniture to sleep in."
name: "You"
type: "text"
text: "Okay, do you know where the original owner moved to?"
name: "Roxy"
type: "text"
text: "Sorry, I don't know. Ask around in the village, some people|might know. But they are not here today, so I think they will return tomorrow."
name: "You"
type: "text"
text: "Can I stay at the yellow house for a while then?"
name: "You"
type: "text"
text: "No problem."
name: " "
type: "text"
text: "(got the key from Roxy.)"
